    {"page": 2, "start": 500, "end": 600, "top": 152.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 515.4, "baseline": 163.25, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "The quick survey of a quiet harbour town begins at dawn, when the fishing boats drift back past the "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 600, "end": 698, "top": 165.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 503.4, "baseline": 176.69, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "lighthouse and the market stalls fold open their striped awnings. Gulls wheel over the quay while "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 698, "end": 797, "top": 179.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 516.0, "baseline": 190.13, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "merchants argue cheerfully about the price of mackerel, and a baker carries warm loaves across the "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 797, "end": 904, "top": 192.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 530.4, "baseline": 203.35, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "cobbles to the cafe on the corner. By noon the visitors arrive, and the narrow streets fill with the sound "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 904, "end": 948, "top": 206.4, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 253.8, "baseline": 216.79, "inkLeft": 72.024, "text": "of voices, bicycle bells and distant music.\u000d"},
    {"page": 2, "start": 948, "end": 1044, "top": 219.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 498.0, "baseline": 230.23, "inkLeft": 108.05, "text": "The quick survey of a quiet harbour town begins at dawn, when the fishing boats drift back past "},
