    {"page": 2, "start": 1140, "end": 1234, "top": 246.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 530.4, "baseline": 257.11, "inkLeft": 108.05, "text": "while merchants argue cheerfully about the price of mackerel, and a baker carries warm loaves "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 1234, "end": 1332, "top": 259.8, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 531.0, "baseline": 270.55, "inkLeft": 108.05, "text": "across the cobbles to the cafe on the corner. By noon the visitors arrive, and the narrow streets "},
    {"page": 2, "start": 1332, "end": 1396, "top": 273.6, "left": 72.0, "lastX": 372.6, "baseline": 284.02, "inkLeft": 108.05, "text": "fill with the sound of voices, bicycle bells and distant music.\u000d"},
